{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["The sense of <b>and I will make you fruitful</b> is that all of them will produce offspring — the fruit of the womb; there will be no sterile male or barren female among them. Then He returned and said, \"and I will multiply you,\" meaning that they will produce many offspring and not miscarry, and they will live out their days, and therefore they will be a numerous people."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:00:42.383170902Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}